<title>SWEDEN: Swedish May retail sales fall 0.6 pct from April.</title>
<headline>Swedish May retail sales fall 0.6 pct from April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales fell 0.6 percent in May from April for a year-on-year rise of 3.8 percent, Sweden's official statistics office Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH RETAIL SALES	  May 97    April 97    May 96</p>
<p> Month/month		     -0.6	 -0.3	 -0.2</p>
<p> Year/year			  3.8	  4.4	 -1.2</p>
<p> Index (1990=100)	     100.1	100.7	 96.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted and revised.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
